5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard equipment is old. We need a system that works with our current scanners.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am worried about the long-term costs. The initial price is just the start.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who is in charge when things break? We need clear ownership from day one.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see what happened with the last system change. It felt messy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We are short on staff. The new system must not overwhelm our remaining team.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, if the cost keeps rising, we can't afford the hardware upgrades.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, exactly. I need to see the renewal invoices to understand the trend.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the last rollout had issues. I need to know who owned the support then.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, yes. I will look at the support ownership during the winter outage.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Mizuki, I agree. I will check the board minutes to see how capital was handled.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will investigate the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the support ownership during last winter's outage and the warehouse rule changes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in 2018.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will investigate the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors and the last rollout.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
