35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The 2021 trial failed because the yard devices were too old. We need compatibility.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The invoices show separate licenses climbing yearly. Bundled deals held price. We need a bundle.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Last winter, support was unowned for two days. We need a single point of contact.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,The dispatch tool skipped upgrades for years. We can't afford another stagnant system.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,Two admins retire this year. The last rollout was ignored by supervisors. We need training.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, if we buy a bundle, will it work with our old scanners?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, I don't know yet. But the cost structure suggests we should avoid modular pieces.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the data lift in 2018 was a disaster. We need a vendor who handles migration well.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, yes. The external team messed up the route codes. We need better integration.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Mizuki, the board minutes show capital is tight. We must be careful with operating costs.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The depot calendar has no freeze window in winter. We need a flexible cutover plan.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The board trimmed capital but approved operating lines. We need a predictable operating cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The warehouse rules changed twice last year. The system must be adaptable to new accounts.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The dispatch tool is on old racks. We need a modern, upgradable platform.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"The supervisors dropped the new steps. We need a vendor who trains the crews, not just admins.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
