60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Candidate C, Anchor, is built for transport and has an engineering team present. That helps with the yard.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Candidate A, Tessera, is a subscription platform. The cost might be predictable, but migration is risky.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Candidate D, Meridian, has a regional service team. That solves the support ownership issue.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Candidate B, Corvus, is modular. That might be too complex for our current staff.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Candidate C has an engineering team present. That helps with the admin retirements and training.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, does Tessera's marketplace have apps for our old scanners?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, I don't know. But the subscription model might hide the true cost of add-ons.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, Corvus's modular nature means more points of failure. I prefer a unified system.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, agreed. The 2018 data lift shows we can't handle fragmented systems.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, Anchor's on-premise deployment might be harder to upgrade, but the team is there.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I am leaning towards Anchor. The engineering team on-site is crucial for our yards.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I am worried about Anchor's long-term maintenance costs. But the on-site team is a plus.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I prefer Meridian. The regional service team ensures clear ownership.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I am concerned about Anchor's upgrade history. But the transport focus is good.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I support Anchor. The presence of the engineering team addresses our staffing crisis.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
